  "name": "Street Fighter III 3rd Strike: Fight for the Future",
  "description": "Street Fighter III 3rd Strike: Fight for the Future is the third and final version of Street Fighter III and is widely regarded as one of the greatest 2D fighting games ever made. It brings back Chun-Li and introduces new fighters Makoto, Remy, Q and Twelve, bringing the roster to 20 characters, including Akuma and the boss Gill. Its signature parry system lets players deflect almost any attack with precise timing, and is complemented by EX special moves, Super Arts selection and a grading system that scores each fight. Hand-drawn animation, a hip-hop and jazz soundtrack and deep competitive gameplay made it a tournament favorite for decades.",
